4
00:00:05,152 --> 00:00:05,929
at eye level

5
00:00:06,314 --> 00:00:08,268
Thirty-three kilometers off Brazil sits

6
00:00:08,298 --> 00:00:10,150
Ilha da Queimada Grande

7
00:00:10,283 --> 00:00:12,006
a steep island completely overrun

8
00:00:12,036 --> 00:00:13,275
