21
00:00:35,254 --> 00:00:36,966
Even worse they don't just slither

22
00:00:36,996 --> 00:00:39,807
underfoot In this silent forest danger

23
00:00:39,837 --> 00:00:41,694
hangs directly above your head

24
00:00:42,084 --> 00:00:44,035
Trapped by rising seas eleven thousand

25
00:00:44,065 --> 00:00:46,023
years ago without mammals thousands

26
00:00:46,053 --> 00:00:47,160
of vipers climbed into

27
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:47,953
the trees

28
00:00:48,271 --> 00:00:49,335
Today they hang coiled

29
00:00:49,365 --> 00:00:51,340
